#import "/src/core.typ": *

#title[Contributing] <page:contributing>

You can contribute to this website by opening a PR to the #repo.org repository.
Feel free open PRs for stylistic changes, typos, or grammatical improvements directly.
If you want to change organizational information, please #link(<page:contact>)[contact an administrator].

= Getting Involved
To contribute to the typst-community repositories, use the issue trackers, discussions, or PRs on the respective project you want to contribute to.

= Transferring a Project <sec:contributing:transferring-a-project>
If you wish to transfer a repository to the typst-community organization, please open a discussion with the #link("https://github.com/orgs/typst-community/discussions/new?category=transfer-requests")[transfer template].
